---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Click Chick Booth"
  description="About Click Chick Booth."
>
  <main class="page-main">
    <section class="page-heading about-heading page-shell">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark">✳</span> A little about us</p>
      <h1>For the moments<br />you wish could <em>stay.</em></h1>
      <p class="page-lede">
        Click Chick Booth is here to make celebrations feel even more memorable—one happy gathering, silly pose, and shared laugh at a time.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-story page-shell">
      <div class="about-stamp" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>GOOD</span><span>TIMES</span><span class="stamp-star">✳</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">The idea behind the booth</p>
        <h2>A reason to get<br /><em>everyone in the frame.</em></h2>
        <p>
          The best parts of a celebration often happen between the big moments: friends catching up, family being wonderfully silly, and everyone squeezing in for one more picture.
        </p>
        <p>
          Click Chick Booth brings a welcoming photo booth experience to the middle of it all. Our aim is simple: help people have fun together and leave with a little piece of the day.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/Services">See what we offer <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-note page-shell">
      <p>Good company.<br /><em>One more picture.</em><br />A memory to keep.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
